<P>She is an Adjunct Professor in the Business Administration Department at Housatonic Community College, Bridgeport, and a member of the Business Department Advi', N'<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.bankwebinars.com/$webfile.send.WEBINARS./PARIS.JPG" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Mary Jane (MJ) Paris brings a broad base of experience in&nbsp; management, leadership and employee development gained from more than 25 years in management, sales, retail banking, training, recruiting, coaching, project management, event planning and community leadership.</P>
